The meanings of a brivla are in fact LARGELY determined by its sumti, but 
are not entirely so.  For example, the places of zmadu and mleca are the 
same; the difference is in the relationship between them.

I'm not going to pretend that I know how to say whatever belongs in each of 
the places I defined, so I can't off the top of my head tell you how to say 
what should go in a lojbanic definition - one reason I think we aren't 
ready for an all-Lojban dictionary.

